---
description: Tailwind and shadcn/ui styling conventions
globs: "**/*.tsx,**/*.css"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Prefer semantic Tailwind tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-primary`) over hardcoded colours.
- Mobile-first; check narrow widths before desktop polish.
- Compose existing `components/ui/` parts before writing new primitives. Details: `docs/design-system.md`.
